    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d210">

                <pb facs="0657" n="1287" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg1287"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-chapter-head">[Würtemberg]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-volume-rules" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1873-12-01T23:59:59-04:56"
                            notBefore="1873-01-01T00:00:00-04:56">undated</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">naturalization</hi>.</p>
                <p>An alien must belong to a commune in order to have the rights of citizenship,
                    unless he has been named to some public employment.<anchor n="4"
                        xml:id="d210-f1"/></p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">expatriation</hi>.</p>
                <p>The rights of citizenship are lost by emigration under the authority of
                    government and by accepting foreign service.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
